<title>POLAND: ComputerLand Q2 net falls to PLN 2.1 mln.</title>
<headline>ComputerLand Q2 net falls to PLN 2.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>ComputerLand SA preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     2.46   vs    2.73</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 3.20   vs    3.81</p>
<p>    net profit			     2.15   vs    2.27</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: ComputerLand SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     42.19   vs   36.78</p>
<p>    costs of sales			32.04   vs   27.43</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00   vs    0.01</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.05   vs    1.54</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		  27.51   vs   26.68</p>
<p>    financial costs		     26.77   vs   25.92</p>
<p>    investment			    36.43   vs    2.75</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     5.32   vs    6.88</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 6.79   vs    7.84</p>
<p>    net profit			     4.60   vs    4.84</p>
<p>    net sales			     77.77   vs   72.48</p>
<p>    costs of sales			58.78   vs   54.57</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00   vs    0.01</p>
<p>    income tax			     2.19   vs    3.00</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		  80.00   vs   34.67</p>
<p>    financial costs		     78.54   vs   33.71</p>
<p>    investment			    36.91   vs    3.31</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
